        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have partnerships with green hosting providers, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification. green hosting providers, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) is also relatively low, at 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
